@startuml Vendor Master API Invocation Flow

participant "Service Bench" as ServiceBench
participant "Experience API" as ExperienceAPI
participant "Wrapper Process API" as WrapperAPI
participant "Vendor Master API" as VendorMaster

== Create Vendor ==
ServiceBench -> ExperienceAPI: POST /vendors
ExperienceAPI -> WrapperAPI: POST /vendors
WrapperAPI -> VendorMaster: PUT /api/vendor-master/vendors
VendorMaster --> WrapperAPI: 201 Created (VendorResponse)
WrapperAPI --> ExperienceAPI: 201 Created
ExperienceAPI --> ServiceBench: 201 Created

== Update Vendor ==
ServiceBench -> ExperienceAPI: PUT /vendors
ExperienceAPI -> WrapperAPI: PUT /vendors
WrapperAPI -> VendorMaster: POST /api/vendor-master/vendors
note right: Audit logged before update
VendorMaster --> WrapperAPI: 200 OK (VendorResponse)
WrapperAPI --> ExperienceAPI: 200 OK
ExperienceAPI --> ServiceBench: 200 OK

== Get All Vendors ==
ServiceBench -> ExperienceAPI: GET /vendors
ExperienceAPI -> WrapperAPI: GET /vendors
WrapperAPI -> VendorMaster: GET /api/vendor-master/vendors
VendorMaster --> WrapperAPI: 200 OK (List<VendorResponse>)
WrapperAPI --> ExperienceAPI: 200 OK
ExperienceAPI --> ServiceBench: 200 OK

== Get Vendor by Code ==
ServiceBench -> ExperienceAPI: GET /vendors?vendorCode=XXX
ExperienceAPI -> WrapperAPI: GET /vendors?vendorCode=XXX
WrapperAPI -> VendorMaster: GET /api/vendor-master/vendors?vendorCode=XXX
VendorMaster --> WrapperAPI: 200 OK (VendorResponse)
WrapperAPI --> ExperienceAPI: 200 OK
ExperienceAPI --> ServiceBench: 200 OK

== Delete Vendor ==
ServiceBench -> ExperienceAPI: DELETE /vendors?vendorCode=XXX
ExperienceAPI -> WrapperAPI: DELETE /vendors?vendorCode=XXX
WrapperAPI -> VendorMaster: DELETE /api/vendor-master/vendors?vendorCode=XXX
note right: Audit logged before delete
VendorMaster --> WrapperAPI: 204 No Content
WrapperAPI --> ExperienceAPI: 204 No Content
ExperienceAPI --> ServiceBench: 204 No Content

== Create Vendor User ==
ServiceBench -> ExperienceAPI: POST /vendor-users
ExperienceAPI -> WrapperAPI: POST /vendor-users
WrapperAPI -> VendorMaster: PUT /api/vendor-master/vendor-users
VendorMaster --> WrapperAPI: 201 Created (VendorUserResponse)
WrapperAPI --> ExperienceAPI: 201 Created
ExperienceAPI --> ServiceBench: 201 Created

== Update Vendor User ==
ServiceBench -> ExperienceAPI: PUT /vendor-users
ExperienceAPI -> WrapperAPI: PUT /vendor-users
WrapperAPI -> VendorMaster: POST /api/vendor-master/vendor-users
note right: Audit logged before update
VendorMaster --> WrapperAPI: 200 OK (VendorUserResponse)
WrapperAPI --> ExperienceAPI: 200 OK
ExperienceAPI --> ServiceBench: 200 OK

== Get All Vendor Users ==
ServiceBench -> ExperienceAPI: GET /vendor-users
ExperienceAPI -> WrapperAPI: GET /vendor-users
WrapperAPI -> VendorMaster: GET /api/vendor-master/vendor-users
VendorMaster --> WrapperAPI: 200 OK (List<VendorUserResponse>)
WrapperAPI --> ExperienceAPI: 200 OK
ExperienceAPI --> ServiceBench: 200 OK

== Get Vendor User by ID ==
ServiceBench -> ExperienceAPI: GET /vendor-users?vendorUserId=123
ExperienceAPI -> WrapperAPI: GET /vendor-users?vendorUserId=123
WrapperAPI -> VendorMaster: GET /api/vendor-master/vendor-users?vendorUserId=123
VendorMaster --> WrapperAPI: 200 OK (VendorUserResponse)
WrapperAPI --> ExperienceAPI: 200 OK
ExperienceAPI --> ServiceBench: 200 OK

== Delete Vendor User ==
ServiceBench -> ExperienceAPI: DELETE /vendor-users?vendorUserId=123
ExperienceAPI -> WrapperAPI: DELETE /vendor-users?vendorUserId=123
WrapperAPI -> VendorMaster: DELETE /api/vendor-master/vendor-users?vendorUserId=123
note right: Audit logged before delete
VendorMaster --> WrapperAPI: 204 No Content
WrapperAPI --> ExperienceAPI: 204 No Content
ExperienceAPI --> ServiceBench: 204 No Content

@enduml
